meta {
  name: 09. List User's Direct Invites
  type: http
  seq: 9
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/invites/direct/me
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

settings {
  encodeUrl: true
  timeout: 0
  forwardAuthorizationHeader: false
}

docs {
  ## Method, Endpoint, and Auth

  `GET /api/v1/invites/direct/me` — Authenticated user; Bearer access token required.

  ## Description

  Lists direct invitations received by the authenticated user, newest first. This endpoint currently returns the complete list and does not accept pagination parameters.

  ## Request

  ### Headers

  | Field | Type | Required | Description |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | `Authorization` | `string` | Yes | `Bearer <access-token>`. |

  ## Response

  **`200 OK`**
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "data": {
      "items": [{
        "id": 12,
        "status": "PENDING",
        "created_at": "2026-11-06T10:00:00Z",
        "group": {"id": 1, "title": "Weekend trip"},
        "sender": {"id": 1, "name": "Owner", "avatar_attachment_id": null}
      }],
      "total": 1
    }
  }
  ```

  ## Errors

  - `401 MISSING_TOKEN` — Access token is missing or invalid.
  - `500 INTERNAL_SERVER_ERROR` — Invitations could not be retrieved.
}
